{"3705940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "At Sixes and Sevens", "steam_appid": 3705940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve probably seen the news. The entire country is waiting for answers in the Veronika case, the 21 years old girl whose life was taken in such a brutal way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pressure is immense, but I trust that with your expertise, we can get to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/3b122e4aba8c6744777eee5e4fcc4f3a.poster.avif?t=1786712704\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/3b122e4aba8c6744777eee5e4fcc4f3a.webm?t=1786712704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/3b122e4aba8c6744777eee5e4fcc4f3a.mp4?t=1786712704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get <strong>a detective job</strong>, and now, on the first day, you have to deal with the <strong>country’s biggest case.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our police are useless, so we’re calling you from abroad. We’ve prepared <strong>every case file</strong>, every shred of evidence and more importantly a brand new, cutting edge <strong>lie detector device</strong> for you. Examine the evidence, interrogate the suspect and deliver your <strong>verdict</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/f00dfe5c7f692c1682c694efb13b95c2.poster.avif?t=1786712704\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/f00dfe5c7f692c1682c694efb13b95c2.webm?t=1786712704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/f00dfe5c7f692c1682c694efb13b95c2.mp4?t=1786712704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Based on a True Story.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just Drink Your Coffee! It’s All in Your Head!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to air pollution and fatigue, if you do not take coffee, <strong>hallucinations</strong> begin, and you start seeing things everywhere, stemming from your <strong>subconscious</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/156dc0f7cbe87f6991ebc2556ddf061b.poster.avif?t=1786712704\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/156dc0f7cbe87f6991ebc2556ddf061b.webm?t=1786712704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/156dc0f7cbe87f6991ebc2556ddf061b.mp4?t=1786712704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It Gets Worse:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fact checking with <strong>a Lie Detector Device</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juggling <strong>Cables</strong> to keep devices running</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search</strong> thorough case files and discover deeper conspiracies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage fatigue induced <strong>hallucinations</strong> through a coffee-making minigame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigating <strong>Non-Euclidean</strong> spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey … <strong>DO NOT</strong> get caught by <strong>THAT THING!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your<strong> Choice</strong> matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Realism </strong>at its finest</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/29357c613d9db185857329c2fe48587a.poster.avif?t=1786712704\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/29357c613d9db185857329c2fe48587a.webm?t=1786712704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/29357c613d9db185857329c2fe48587a.mp4?t=1786712704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve probably seen the news. The entire country is waiting for answers in the Veronika case, the 21 years old girl whose life was taken in such a brutal way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pressure is immense, but I trust that with your expertise, we can get to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/extras/3b122e4aba8c6744777eee5e4fcc4f3a.poster.avif?t=1786712704\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705940/ext